<p>Baithe na kabhi zere falak chain se dam bhar, aye shaafiye mehshar,<br>
Ummat ne diye apko azaar pe azaar, ya Ahmade Muqtar.</p>

<p>Dil apka bewajah laeenou ne dukhaya, duniya ne sataya,<br>
