<p>Zaaher me the sab dost magar dushmane jaa'n the, mardood jaha'n the,<br>
Baad aapke kya kya na kiya zulm ka izhaar, ya Ahmade Muqtar.</p>

<p>Darwaza gira zakhmi hua pehlu e Zehra, aur ek yehi kya,<br>
