<p>Thi mout Ali ko yuhi Zehra ki judai, phir tegh bhi khayi,<br>
Aqir ko sitam sehke uthe Haidere Karrar, ya Ahmade Muqtar.</p>

<p>Phir zeher se mara Hasane sabz qaba ko, pabande bala ko,<br>
Bekas ke janaze pe huwi teerou ki bochaar, ya Ahmade Muqtar.</p>

<p>Shabbir ka marna toh qayamat tha ghazab tha, wa hasrato darda,<br>
Woh tashnalabi bewatani aur woh azaar, ya Ahmade Muqtar.</p>

<p>Zakhm itne sahe dil pe yeh Hazrath ka jigar tha, sab peshe nazar tha,<br>
Ghar deke huwe baqshish e ummat ke talabgaar, ya Ahmade Muqtar.</p>

<p>Hai mout ghulamou ke liye apki rehlat, aye shaafiye ummat,<br>
